   "content": "<p>尊敬的用户：<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;您好！<br>\n\n &nbsp; &nbsp; 绍兴手机报等6份手机报产品拟于2026年11月15日正式停止服务并下线，届时将不再提供内容更新与服务。如时间变动将再次告知。<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; 特此公告！</p>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<br>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.10086.cn/uploadBaseDir/content/zip/20261014/20261014154740058nrc.zip\" target=\"_blank\" download=\"下线手机报-公告.zip\">下线手机报-公告.zip</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:right\">中国移动通信集团浙江有限公司</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:right\">2026年10月15日</div><p><br>\n</p>\n<p><br>\n</p>",
